        "email": "mike.kinney@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-11-19T17:17:12Z"
      },
      "message": "wip(xtask): prebuild batch crates separately and run suites in parallel lanes\n\nSplit plan::batch's single debug build into one debug_build_crate prebuild per\nbatch crate and ui so Cargo feature unification no longer forces suite steps to\nrecompile and relink upstream crates. Enable Run::lanes and Run::run_lanes for\nbatch (and quick fallback to batch), reading timings from batch-* or release-*\nruns via lanes::history_for while keeping ISOLATED targets, ui, and clippy alone.\n\nRefs #2727",
